  "id": "experience",
  "term": "experience",
  "definition": "In historical psychology, experience means conscious life as it unfolds in time, either as a particular episode someone undergoes or as the total course of mental events. In a broader mental or psychic sense, it can also mean immediately given phenomena before reflection separates them into subject and object.",
